h jacob  far away from the battle  alice gets them fake documents including  a license and passport  the name seen on jacob's items is jacob  wolf wolf get it because  you know he turns into a wolf yeah  there's a pretty funny blink and you'll  miss it moment  in breaking dawn part one while on their  honeymoon  bella goes into the bathroom to freshen  up this includes brushing her teeth  however when she goes to put the  toothpaste on the brush  she completely misses and squirts  toothpaste into the sink  we've all had a moment of toothpaste  trouble but it's so weird that they left  this in the scene  especially since in the next shot we see  that the toothpaste  is perfectly on her brush jacob's wolf  form and human form  are obviously very different but one  thing you would expect  might be the same is their eye color but  this isn't the case  there seems to be a discrepancy in how  brown his eyes are  in human form he has dark brown eyes  whilst in wolf form  he has lighter eyes this is a tough one  to catch  but you'll be able to see it now that  you know you don't live in the world you  think you do  twilight author stephanie meyer made an  appearance in the first twilight movie  that went  unnoticed by many she can be spotted in  the diner sitting at the counter with  her laptop out  meyer was actually reluctant to do this  cameo and didn't want it to be so  obvious  i was thinking it was going to be more  like a where's waldo thing  like i walk by for one second in a crowd  and if they can find me  cool apparently she was talked into it  again as she also appeared at bella and  edward's wedding  here's your veggie plate stop me when  edward and bella are in the cafeteria  bella knocks over an apple which edward  catches and holds out for her  which mimics the twilight book cover  it's a nice nod to the iconic imagery on  the cover of the popular novel  after jasper's outburst towards bella's  blood carlisle patches bella up  when he's done he made sure to b